OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMan with scalded foot rescued from
OL,4,APeak District
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs his foot became blistered and
OL,7,Fpainful it was "too difficult for him
OL,8,Fto walk", so volunteers made their way
OL,9,Fto Pym Chair, where the injured party
OL,10,Fwas given pain relief and had his
OL,11,Finjury treated.
OL,13,FThe rescue team said they gave him "a
OL,14,Fbit of support" and helped him to walk
OL,15,Fback to their vehicles at Edale Cross,
OL,16,Fwhere he was driven onto his friends'
OL,17,Fcars and taken to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
